<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cypress raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cypress raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has raised its rating of Cypress Semiconductor Corp to buy from hold, a source at the brokerage said Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the San Jose, Calif., company closed Tuesday at 13-5/8.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
